                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alimwi nzookupa zijaluzyo zya-Bwami bwakujulu, nkabela zyoonse nzyoti kaange ansi ziyooangwa kujulu, azyalo zyoonse nzyoti kaangulule ansi ziyooangululwa kujulu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
