                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkaambo umwi aumwi uuyanda kuliyobweda buumi bwakwe uzoobusweekelwa, pele umwi aumwi uusweekelwa buumi bwakwe nkaambo kandime uzoobujana. ",
          "type": "text",
