                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ncobeni ndamwaambila kuti mpobali bamwi baimvwi awa batakooyoomvwa lufu mane lumwi bakabone Mwana a-Muntu uuboola mu-Bwami bwakwe.",
          "type": "text",
